    "body": "`git-repository` has been published and is now at version 0.19. Furthermore I made some suggestions which will remove some boilerplate.\r\n\r\nOverall, I am happy to see how the `gitoxide` version overall seems to require less lines of code without loosing clarity. It certainly also comes at the cost of having to deal with `ThreadSaveRepository` which might be a little confusing at first (but I see no way around it either).",
